  PlayerCount: 6
  SizeTag: LARGE / 3v3
  Description: "Three warbands to a shore, split by a river nothing fords. Two stone
    spans are the only way over, and a well stands at each of the four bridgeheads
    \u2014 cross through the blight, or break the well first. Home ground is rich
    and safe; the river is not."
